,"created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107188#pullrequestreview-2905676007","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107188","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-06-06T18:11:51Z"},{"id":2905677635,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6tMR9D","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code and documentation looks good to me. I like the addition of the encoding time metric :slightly_smiling_face: \r\n\r\n**Testing project:** https://github.com/Calinou/godot-movie-maker-demo\r\n\r\nExample output file with the default settings:\r\n\r\n```\r\nInput #0, ogg, from 'out.ogv':\r\n  Duration: 00:00:30.00, start: 0.000000, bitrate: 27760 kb/s\r\n  Stream #0:0: Video: theora, yuv420p, 1280x720 [SAR 1:1 DAR 16:9], 60 fps, 60 tbr, 60 tbn\r\n  Stream #0:1: Audio: vorbis, 48000 Hz, stereo, fltp, 96 kb/s\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe file plays back correctly in mpv.\r\n\r\nEncoding speeds (measured on a debug build):\r\n\r\n### OGV\r\n\r\n```\r\nDone recording movie at path: /tmp/out.ogv\r\n1800 frames at 60 FPS (movie length: 00:00:30:00), recorded in 00:01:41 (29% of real-time speed).\r\nCPU time: 1.40 seconds (average: 0.78 ms/frame)\r\nGPU time: 10.53 seconds (average: 5.85 ms/frame)\r\nEncoding time: 30.79 seconds (average: 17.10 ms/frame)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### AVI\r\n\r\n```\r\nDone recording movie at path: /tmp/out.avi\r\n1800 frames at 60 FPS (movie length: 00:00:30:00), recorded in 00:01:35 (31% of real-time speed).\r\nCPU time: 1.39 seconds (average: 0.77 ms/frame)\r\nGPU time: 9.57 seconds (average: 5.32 ms/frame)\r\nEncoding time: 28.88 seconds (average: 16.04 ms/frame)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### PNG/WAV\r\n\r\n```\r\nDone recording movie at path: /tmp/out.png\r\n1800 frames at 60 FPS (movie length: 00:00:30:00), recorded in 00:04:01 (12% of real-time speed).\r\nCPU time: 1.56 seconds (average: 0.87 ms/frame)\r\nGPU time: 33.50 seconds (average: 18.61 ms/frame)\r\nEncoding time: 148.37 seconds (average: 82.43 ms/frame)\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou can add an `OGV` capitalization here so the Project Settings category uses correct casing: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/26df04377e897595495980309535064e1bacdf53/editor/editor_property_name_processor.cpp#L247","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107188#pullrequestreview-2905677635","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107188","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-06-06T18:12:43Z"},{"id":2905679300,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6tMSXE","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107188#pullrequestreview-2905679300","pull_request_url":"https://api.g